# m2_play: the preview GIF script. A on the title at 30, hold still and fire through the
# opening gnat strings (60-239), then sweep up 40 / hold 20 / down 40 / hold 20 to 3960.
# Since M5 there is no bomb; two short hold-B rewinds:
# - B 2084..2093 (10 frames = 20 ticks): game tick 2053 -> 2033, fuel 180 -> 160. The
#   inputs keep their update indices, so after the release the sweep runs 30 ticks ahead of
#   the world (10 frames not simulated + 20 ticks undone).
# - B 3320..3334 (15 frames = 30 ticks) in the 54 s wave: game tick 3258 -> 3228, fuel
#   180 -> 150 (the refill had topped it up again).
# The press frame is already MANUAL (state 5); the release frame is PLAYING without a tick.
# Since M7 (Bullet hell for real) the sweep cannot live through stage 1 any more: in a normal
# game it spends its three rewinds by 1627 and dies. So it now plays in the endless probe mode
# (debug_probe at 31: a hit is counted in debug_hits and charges the power loss, a level and a
# fork, plus 80 mercy, at once; no rewind, the game goes on), and the old "survives with all
# three rewinds" pin becomes M7's acceptance bound for the sweep in stage 1: at least 6 hits
# (PLAN.md M7 "Difficulty targets"; 10 when re-pinned). Crates on the way: F2 at 900 (the
# beetle's F), the hit at 1022 takes it back (F1, mercy 136 -> 216), fork 1 at 2010, the A
# crate at 2402 swaps F1 for A1 (11), the retry shield at 2433 absorbs the hit at 2684
# (shield 0, hits still 6), F2 again at 3855. Identity 0 on every frame from 31 when written.
--frames 4000 --call-at "31 debug_probe" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_score,debug_hits,debug_fuel,debug_grazes,debug_weapon,debug_forks --expect "debug_score > 570" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_hits >= 6" --expect "debug_phase == 0" --at "899 debug_weapon == 1" --at "900 debug_weapon == 2" --at "1021 debug_hits == 2" --at "1022 debug_hits == 3" --at "1022 debug_weapon == 1" --at "1022 debug_mercy == 216" --at "2010 debug_forks == 1" --at "2083 debug_state == 1" --at "2084 debug_state == 5" --at "2093 debug_fuel == 160" --at "2094 debug_state == 1" --at "2094 debug_game_tick == 2033" --at "2402 debug_weapon == 11" --at "2433 debug_shield == 1" --at "2683 debug_shield == 1" --at "2684 debug_shield == 0" --at "2684 debug_hits == 6" --at "3320 debug_state == 5" --at "3334 debug_game_tick == 3228" --at "3335 debug_state == 1" --at "3335 debug_fuel == 150" --at "1500 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2090 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3999 debug_history_check == 0"
